:"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-17T17:40:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-17T17:40:37Z","body":"As this PR currently stands, repositioning a `CollisionShape3D` snaps its origin to the surface, while nodes with a `VisualInstance3D` get an AABB offset. The offset should apply regardless of geometry type for a full fix. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4471865267/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4472694585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119512#issuecomment-4472694585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119512","id":4472694585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCpfnOQ","user":{"login":"ping-jor","id":212674138,"node_id":"U_kgDODK0mWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212674138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor","html_url":"https://github.com/ping-jor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-17T22:24:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-17T22:24:01Z","body":"Thanks for the review! I've added the suggested inlining. \r\n\r\nReally good catch on the offset issue. I checked `_calculate_spatial_bounds` and saw it was returning an empty AABB for non-visual nodes, which explains the sinking origin behavior. \r\n\r\nI'm fixing this right now by getting the AABB via `get_debug_mesh()` for shapes, and **calculating it manually** for polygons. I'll push the fix as soon as I finish testing. Cheers!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4472694585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4475742481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119512#issuecomment-4475742481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119512","id":4475742481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCsZpEQ","user":{"login":"ping-jor","id":212674138,"node_id":"U_kgDODK0mWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212674138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor","html_url":"https://github.com/ping-jor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T08